                                                "sense_id": "2eda0e9b-0b98-3c43-ba81-40ee85c13902",
                                                "text": "The absence of keyboardist Sadie Shaw (who split for the Bay Area garage rawkers the Husbands) allows the group more space to indulge in dark wordless experiments; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e61b0823-60b5-4d81-a785-b7dcef8e7500",
                                                "sense_id": "2eda0e9b-0b98-3c43-ba81-40ee85c13902",
                                                "text": "Since the 1960s, the keyboardist, vibraphonist and percussionist Mulatu Astatke has been a prime mover in Ethio-jazz: unmistakably Ethiopian music that also draws on American jazz, Afro-Caribbean music and more."
                                            }
